        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Though you are an artisan, you are well versed in using the tools of your trade to fend off enemies. While wielding a weapon in the hammer, knife, or pick weapon group, you can use that weapon to etch runes without an @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Artisan's Toolkit]. Additionally, a Strike with a hammer, knife, or pick deals 1 additional fire damage to an enemy bearing one of your runes as sparks fly on impact like a hammer to an anvil.</p>"
